WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.166
I love to play with Hada.

2
00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:12.825
Whenever I go near him, he turns his head to look at me.

3
00:00:12.826 --> 00:00:16.847
How does he know that I am there?

4
00:00:16.848 --> 00:00:19.157
Hana: Mom, look at Hada.

5
00:00:19.158 --> 00:00:21.308
Mom: Is something wrong?

6
00:00:21.309 --> 00:00:23.840
Hana: Hada is smiling at me.

7
00:00:23.841 --> 00:00:27.673
Hana: Maybe he is happy because I changed his diaper.

8
00:00:27.674 --> 00:00:30.493
Mom: I guess so.

9
00:00:30.494 --> 00:00:34.133
Hana: You like your big sister, don't you, Hada?

10
00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:36.737
Yes, you do. Come on.

11
00:00:36.738 --> 00:00:39.106
Hana: Smile back at me again.

12
00:00:39.107 --> 00:00:43.442
There you go. Good boy!

13
00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:46.173
Mom: Hana, it's time for bed.

14
00:00:46.174 --> 00:00:50.023
Hana: Okay, Mom. I have to go to bed now.

15
00:00:50.024 --> 00:00:55.102
Hana: See you tomorrow, Hada. Good night.

16
00:00:55.103 --> 00:00:59.488
Hada must know that I am his big sister.

17
00:00:59.489 --> 00:01:02.642
He always smiles when I talk to him.

18
00:01:02.643 --> 00:01:06.449
Mom says that babies can smell well.

19
00:01:06.450 --> 00:01:11.187
Can they smell like dogs? I wonder . . .
